.TXT 4 0 19 0
Cg a62.125000,62.000000,475
{\rtf1\ansi \deff0
{\fonttbl
{\f0\fnil Arial;}
{\f1\fnil Symbol;}
{\f2\fnil CG Times;}
}
{\plain {We note that the output corresponding
 to each input also appears to be a complex
 exponential at the same frequency, but 
with a phase shift and amplitude change.
  We now prove it. }{By}{ }{\ul \b Problem
 2.3}{, }{  ec}{\dn8 pod(n,N)}{\dn8 ,k}{
 = ec}{\dn8 n,k}{ . Therefore\par ec}{\dn8 
pod(n-m,N),k}{ = ec}{\dn8 n-m,k}{ = ec}{\dn8 
n,k}{ ec}{\dn8 -m,k}{ and ec}{\dn8 -m,k}{
 = conjugate(ec}{\dn8 m,k}{). So the periodic
 convolution (3.2a) }{ is alternatively 
expressed as }{ }}
}
