{\plain {Notice that the sample average 
of the DFT magnitude of an uncorrelated 
sequence is approximately a constant (for
 L sufficiently large). Such a sequence 
is called }{\b white}{, in analogy to the
 magnitudes of the nearly equal components
 of ordinary, or white, light at each frequency}}
}
